D[76295]={"^Deals (.-) Nature damage to the target instantly%. Has a 10%% chance to reset the cooldown of Gift of the Loa%. |cFFFF00FFThis ability Invokes the Loa Sseratus%.|r%s*$","causa {{1}} de dano de Natureza ao alvo instantaneamente. Tem 10% de chance de reiniciar a recarga de Presente do Loa. |cFFFF00FFEsta habilidade Evocar a Sseratus.|r"}
